WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Board columns. Add, rename, reorder and delete a project's board columns, each tied to a status.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: code review; waiting on others.

3
00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.290
Every project starts with Todo, In progress and Done.

4
00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:17.370
Choose Add column…

5
00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:21.010
…and say which status its cards have.

6
00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:22.600
Edit column opens its settings…

7
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.930
…where Left and Right reorder it — Review now sits before Done.

8
00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:31.100
Drag cards into it by their grip.

9
00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:37.100
Delete refuses on a column: It's the last column for its status. Add another column for that status first.

10
00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:41.600
Columns mapped to statuses
